  <p id="c-jinshu-007-jin076-yutan:coalition" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">吳興太守<persName id="c-jinshu-007-jin076-yutan:coalition:m0004" ref="9v9_cj5_dor">虞潭</persName>與<persName id="c-jinshu-007-jin076-yutan:coalition:m0007" ref="4qr_wrk_3vd_D">庚冰</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-007-jin076-yutan:coalition:m0010" ref="nbl_2bu_99w">王舒</persName>等起義兵于三吳。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-007-jin076-yutan:promotion" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">以吳國內史<persName id="c-jinshu-007-jin076-yutan:promotion:m0005" ref="9v9_cj5_dor">虞潭</persName>爲衛將軍。</p>
